Where is Ai?
Ai in cybersecurity is everywhere; however it is mostly used for Automated Incident Response, which is a way of responding directly to security breaches. 
AI can automatically block suspicious activities and make sure that your system is not being attacked. 
AI is used to examine emails and make sure that your email is not a scam or that your information is not being compromised. 
Ai is also in the network to make sure there are no intrusions.
It identifies risks and makes sure compromised accounts do not have access to valuable information.

